      "text": "After breakfast, visit the Brazilian side of the falls. The walking trails follow the canyon of the Iguaçu River past hundreds of smaller waterfalls, ending right in front of the immense Devil’s Throat, the most powerful of all, where you feel the falls up close among mist and rainbows. At the end of the tour, your guide takes you back to the hotel.\n\nIncluded: Transfers · Brazilian side of the falls with guide and entrance ticket · Breakfast",
